OL,3,GNEWSAMan finds three-foot snake curled
OL,4,Aup in his toilet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has said he was left stunned
OL,7,Fafter discovering a snake emerging from
OL,8,Fhis downstairs toilet.
OL,10,FDavid Claridge, of Bracknell,
OL,11,FBerkshire, lifted the toilet's lid on
OL,12,FTuesday morning and saw something
OL,13,Fyellow and black protruding from the
OL,14,Fbowl.
OL,16,FUpon closer inspection, he said he
OL,17,Frecognised it was a three-foot (0.9m)
OL,18,Flong grass snake.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
