OL,3,GNEWSAMan finds three-foot snake curled
OL,4,Aup in his toilet
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 79-year-old, who promptly evicted
OL,7,Fthe reptile from his property with a
OL,8,Fpair of barbecue tongs, said he
OL,9,Fbelieves it must have crawled up
OL,10,Fthrough the drain after seeking water
OL,11,Fduring recent hot weather.
